ヶ咲 麗","creatorId":"vndb:s4314","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4314","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4314","name":"天ヶ咲 麗","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:161801","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c87733","characterName":"高崎 のぞみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"75916","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"294942"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22539"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87733"},"originalCharacterName":"高崎 のぞみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"327"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"105"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"I"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"96"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Family, Housework, Children, Insects, Sweets"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: There is a little clumsy aspect to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ikuto's step-mother. The main heroine of this game, she's still a virgin. A nursery school teacher who Ikuto meets at his part time job, who is older than him. Even though Ikuto yearns for her after feeling her overwhelming motherhood on their first meeting, she becomes his step-mother after his father remarried her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For Ikuto, who doesn't have a mother, she wants to be an ideal mother and takes care of housework, which is her specality. Not just that, she worries about Ikuto who is inexperienced about women, so thinking for his future, she resolves to use her own body to teach him about women. That skinship becomes commonplace and gradually escalates with no way of stopping."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a mother, I have to teach you about women properly."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In her route, it was found out that Ikuto' father didn't submit their marriage registration papers, and mistakenly brought them with him on his trip. So, she and Ikuto's father are just engaged, not married."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87733"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のメインヒロイン。処女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"郁人が保育園で出会った少し年上の保育士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初対面で、圧倒的な母性を感じた憧れの女性だが、郁人の父親とのぞみが再婚したことで継母となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親がいなかった郁人のために、理想の母親となるべく得意の家事で甲斐甲斐しくお世話をしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それどころか、女性との付き合いが全くなかった郁人を心配して、将来のためにと、意を決して自らの身を使って女性の体の仕組みを教えてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのスキンシップが日常化すると、次第にブレーキが利かなくなり、エスカレートしていくことに……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22539","sourceWorkId":"28933","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のメインヒロイン。処女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"郁人が保育園で出会った少し年上の保育士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初対面で、圧倒的な母性を感じた憧れの女性だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"郁人の父親とのぞみが再婚したことで継母となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親がいなかった郁人のために、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理想の母親となるべく得意の家事で甲斐甲斐しくお世話をしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それどころか、女性との付き合いが全くなかった郁人を心配して、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"将来のためにと、意を決して自らの身を使って女性の体の仕組みを教えてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのスキンシップが日常化すると、次第にブレーキが利かなくなり、エスカレートしていくことに……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「じゃあ、お母さんとして、きちんと女の人のことを教えないといけないわ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75916"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75916","value":"家族、家事、子ども、昆虫、甘いもの"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75916","value":"保育士"},{"label":"苦手","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"75916","value":"すこしドジな一面もある"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo